"This chapter covers the basic actions <xref linkend=\"anchor-installing\"/>, "
"<xref linkend=\"anchor-removing\"/> and <xref linkend=\"anchor-upgrading\"/> "
"of packages."
msgstr ""

#: ../help/C/synaptic.xml:799(para)
msgid ""
